{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ei2i3rNcu11794798166.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>電競《英雄聯盟》全球總決賽，中國戰隊「BLG」擊敗韓國代表，隊史首奪世界冠軍。</p><p></p><p>今屆賽事在美國紐約舉行，容納兩萬名觀眾的場館全場滿座。中國戰隊「BLG」首輪三勝兩負，驚險出線，之後再擊敗兩支韓國戰隊，包括四強淘汰爭取四連霸的「T1」。</p><p></p><p>五場三勝的決賽面對「GEN.G」，即使先輸一場，但「BLG」連贏三場反勝，以3-1封王，隊史首度捧起世界冠軍，亦是相隔五年，再有中國賽區戰隊奪得召喚師盃。</p><p></p><p>在成都舉行的《王者榮耀》KPL年度總決賽，就由北京「WB」戰隊苦戰七局下，擊敗同樣北京的「JDG」戰隊，捧起聖龍盃。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:04.018676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:24.748754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:28.474801+00:00","content_hash":"dcfbb6600ed473542cd75447ece34c6981d5dbad91b6e3b6db5491d65f59408c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:04.018676+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}